    {
      "name": "Glimpse of Redemption",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy damages the shabti's ally, and both the enemy and ally are within 15 feet of the shabti</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The shabti's foe hesitates under the weight of sin as visions of redemption play in their mind's eye. The foe must choose one of the following options:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The ally is unharmed by the triggering damage.</li>\n<li>The ally gains resistance 6 to the triggering damage. After the damaging effect is applied, the enemy becomes Enfeebled 2 until the end of its next turn.</li>\n</ul>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Immortal",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Shabti don't age naturally and can't die of old age. Spells and effects that cause aging still affect a shabti as normal. They also can't be turned into undead.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
